WEBVTT

00:02:00.910 --> 00:02:02.260
That's...

00:02:02.260 --> 00:02:06.650
The Skrugg's... spaceship!

00:02:32.410 --> 00:02:33.940
It's so big...

00:02:33.940 --> 00:02:36.630
I can believe anything now...

00:02:56.400 --> 00:02:58.380
You've got to be kiddin' me!

00:02:58.380 --> 00:03:02.620
The chief told us to shoot that thing down with <i>these?</i>

00:03:02.620 --> 00:03:05.690
That's like takin' a grizzly down with your bare hands!

00:03:05.690 --> 00:03:09.720
Wait a sec... Please, tell me what's going on here...

00:03:09.720 --> 00:03:11.420
Is this really happening?

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:13.090
How the hell should I know?

00:03:31.100 --> 00:03:33.340
Where is the report from the reconnaissance team?

00:03:33.340 --> 00:03:35.360
Communications have remained silent.

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:37.860
No matter. Begin!

00:04:40.210 --> 00:04:43.570
Hurry Joey! Everyone evacuate!

00:04:43.570 --> 00:04:44.460
Right!

00:04:44.460 --> 00:04:47.050
But, where should we run to?

00:04:47.380 --> 00:04:50.680
We were taught to gather at the city hall if something like this happened.

00:04:50.980 --> 00:04:51.720
Let's go!

00:04:58.370 --> 00:04:59.610
That's in the direction of my house...

00:05:03.200 --> 00:05:05.740
I'm going to check on my grandma!

00:05:05.740 --> 00:05:06.740
Wait!

00:05:08.090 --> 00:05:09.370
I'm coming, too.

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:10.240
But...

00:05:10.240 --> 00:05:11.600
Don't worry.

00:05:14.010 --> 00:05:17.160
As long as I've got this guy, I can handle it.

00:05:18.790 --> 00:05:19.870
Okay, let's get a move on.

00:05:19.870 --> 00:05:20.700
Wait a sec!

00:05:20.700 --> 00:05:21.700
Let me come, too!

00:05:21.700 --> 00:05:23.590
You take care of the professor, Lina.

00:05:23.890 --> 00:05:25.290
We're countin' on you.

00:05:27.590 --> 00:05:28.590
Hold it!

00:05:30.130 --> 00:05:31.440
Will!

00:05:35.280 --> 00:05:37.060
Where are you planning on going?

00:05:37.060 --> 00:05:39.060
And why the hell would we tell <i>you</i> something like...

00:05:40.180 --> 00:05:41.710
I'm going to my house.

00:05:42.050 --> 00:05:43.120
Bye.

00:05:44.770 --> 00:05:46.920
We're not done talking here.

00:05:48.230 --> 00:05:51.440
What are you going to use that robot for?

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:55.340
You plan on becoming a hero or something?

00:05:55.340 --> 00:05:57.370
I'm not really...

00:05:57.370 --> 00:05:59.200
I won't accept it.

00:05:59.200 --> 00:06:02.780
I'll never accept someone like <i>you</i> being a hero!

00:06:04.980 --> 00:06:06.730
Stop it, Will!

00:06:09.190 --> 00:06:11.930
All I'm doing is going home.

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:14.600
Let's go!

00:06:16.850 --> 00:06:19.310
Chickens like you should turn-tail and run!

00:06:19.590 --> 00:06:20.860
Say that again!

00:06:22.570 --> 00:06:25.270
Come on! We've got to hurry and evacuate!

00:06:29.370 --> 00:06:31.030
Why those little...

00:06:50.430 --> 00:06:51.810
I didn't copy that...

00:06:51.810 --> 00:06:53.220
Please repeat.

00:06:55.430 --> 00:06:58.340
Just to double check... This is not a joke, correct?

00:06:58.340 --> 00:06:59.630
What's wrong?

00:07:02.260 --> 00:07:04.760
Mr. President, we have a matter of grave importance.

00:07:04.760 --> 00:07:06.270
A matter of grave importance?

00:07:25.110 --> 00:07:27.050
I take back what I said!

00:07:27.050 --> 00:07:30.460
This is more like ants tryin' to stand up to an elephant!

00:07:34.050 --> 00:07:37.640
Shouldn't we high-tail it out of here while we still can?

00:07:38.040 --> 00:07:39.820
No kidding...

00:07:44.190 --> 00:07:45.940
It's the army!

00:07:55.340 --> 00:07:57.960
America, hell yeah!

00:08:32.950 --> 00:08:34.270
How awful...

00:08:35.240 --> 00:08:36.380
Joey!

00:08:39.680 --> 00:08:41.070
Why'd you do that?

00:08:47.420 --> 00:08:48.810
It's them.

00:08:48.810 --> 00:08:49.900
What should we do?

00:08:49.900 --> 00:08:50.880
Uh...

00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:52.740
Should we let them pass by?

00:08:52.740 --> 00:08:55.120
Or bust 'em up with your pal there?

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:06.950
I'm worried about my grandma. Let's wait for them to pass.

00:09:06.950 --> 00:09:08.100
Okay.

00:10:07.370 --> 00:10:09.790
Eat this, you cockroach sonofabitches!

00:10:19.510 --> 00:10:20.970
All right!

00:10:19.510 --> 00:10:20.970
Yeah!

00:10:41.090 --> 00:10:42.010
Joey...

00:10:43.730 --> 00:10:45.820
Joey, Joey!

00:10:46.220 --> 00:10:47.200
Hurry up.

00:10:48.630 --> 00:10:50.480
Y-Yeah...

00:10:55.440 --> 00:10:57.650
Balzac 1 to squadron...

00:10:57.650 --> 00:10:59.540
Balzac 1 to squadron...

00:10:59.540 --> 00:11:01.350
Maintain formation.

00:11:01.350 --> 00:11:06.330
Approach at low-altitude until 7 miles to target, then break, climb, and begin attack!

00:11:06.720 --> 00:11:07.430
Copy that?

00:11:08.130 --> 00:11:10.740
Don't go giving the ground any kisses now, you hear!

00:11:10.740 --> 00:11:12.190
Roger that!

00:11:18.420 --> 00:11:19.690
Begin attack!

00:11:35.180 --> 00:11:36.210
Impossible!

00:11:44.850 --> 00:11:46.350
Evasive maneuvers!

00:11:46.350 --> 00:11:48.720
Reform and regroup!

00:11:55.160 --> 00:11:57.980
To think there would be such a difference in our powers.

00:11:59.040 --> 00:12:02.500
There is now nothing for us to fear.

00:12:02.500 --> 00:12:06.210
Proceed to the next step in the plan!

00:13:06.010 --> 00:13:07.800
Fire!

00:13:17.200 --> 00:13:18.690
Don't push!

00:13:18.690 --> 00:13:19.560
One at a time!

00:13:24.460 --> 00:13:26.820
Everything will be fine. Calm down.

00:13:28.770 --> 00:13:30.320
This is my fault...

00:13:31.050 --> 00:13:33.570
If I hadn't broadcast that transmission, then this...

00:13:34.090 --> 00:13:35.900
Then this wouldn't have...

00:13:37.580 --> 00:13:39.030
Will?

00:13:43.890 --> 00:13:44.780
Hey...

00:13:45.240 --> 00:13:46.050
Lina!

00:13:46.350 --> 00:13:47.700
Have you seen my brother?

00:13:47.700 --> 00:13:49.120
I don't know where he is.

00:13:49.120 --> 00:13:51.120
He was here a little while ago, but...

00:13:51.120 --> 00:13:53.380
We came here together, right?

00:13:53.380 --> 00:13:55.100
Did you guys hear where he was going?

00:13:55.400 --> 00:13:57.710
I told you, we don't know.

00:13:57.710 --> 00:13:59.810
You should ask Nick.

00:13:59.810 --> 00:14:02.520
Now that you mention it, I haven't seen him around either.

00:14:17.060 --> 00:14:20.570
W-What are you planning on doing, Will?

00:14:20.570 --> 00:14:22.170
Good question.

00:14:22.170 --> 00:14:26.050
How about sneaking into their saucer?

00:14:26.050 --> 00:14:27.770
What? No way!

00:14:27.770 --> 00:14:32.150
Didn't you just see? Even the military is no match for them!

00:14:32.150 --> 00:14:33.700
Exactly.

00:14:33.700 --> 00:14:34.850
What do you mean?

00:14:35.860 --> 00:14:38.980
Look here. I have an idea.

00:14:40.020 --> 00:14:42.090
You don't have to come, you know.

00:14:42.090 --> 00:14:44.060
Oh, no... I'll come, too!

00:14:45.010 --> 00:14:49.030
<i>If I stick with Will, I might get famous!</i>

00:14:49.950 --> 00:14:53.030
<i>I'll be the one that becomes the hero!</i>

00:14:53.530 --> 00:14:56.300
<i>Just you watch, Psy, Joey!</i>

00:15:12.440 --> 00:15:14.480
Somehow the house looks like it's safe.

00:15:14.480 --> 00:15:15.390
Thank goodness!

00:15:24.230 --> 00:15:24.770
Joey!

00:15:34.630 --> 00:15:37.250
Hey! Your grandma comes first, right?

00:15:37.250 --> 00:15:38.360
I have to stop them!

00:15:38.360 --> 00:15:41.960
If they destroy any more, my grandma'll die of shock!

00:15:42.300 --> 00:15:44.230
I'm counting on you, Heroman.

00:15:44.230 --> 00:15:45.660
Hey, Joey!

00:15:46.230 --> 00:15:47.630
Hurry up!

00:15:54.580 --> 00:15:56.270
W-Wait!

00:15:56.270 --> 00:15:57.390
T-Time out!

00:16:01.250 --> 00:16:03.390
Uh... Well...

00:16:41.380 --> 00:16:43.210
Heroman...

00:16:43.850 --> 00:16:45.390
Engage!

00:17:47.870 --> 00:17:49.040
Heroman!

00:17:56.050 --> 00:17:57.670
Heroman!

00:18:01.140 --> 00:18:02.350
Joey!

00:18:32.070 --> 00:18:33.460
All right!

00:18:35.860 --> 00:18:38.260
Heroman, I'll fight, too!

00:18:39.130 --> 00:18:41.260
I won't leave you alone.

00:18:49.380 --> 00:18:50.530
What's this?

00:18:59.610 --> 00:19:01.990
Heroman...

00:19:01.990 --> 00:19:03.240
Blast!

00:19:58.500 --> 00:20:00.210
All right!

00:20:19.600 --> 00:20:20.440
Grandma!

00:20:29.650 --> 00:20:32.710
Oh? Joey, Psy... Why are you here?

00:20:32.710 --> 00:20:34.620
Why are we here?

00:20:34.620 --> 00:20:36.660
You didn't notice?

00:20:36.980 --> 00:20:38.230
Notice what?

00:20:40.520 --> 00:20:44.200
Now that you mention it, it's been quite noisy outside today.

00:20:44.800 --> 00:20:45.800
Is something going on?

00:20:47.760 --> 00:20:50.420
And why aren't you two at school?

00:21:15.390 --> 00:21:19.300
<i>Attention, all living things on this planet.</i>

00:21:19.300 --> 00:21:23.420
<i>Attention, all living things on this planet.</i>

00:21:23.420 --> 00:21:28.140
<i>Attention, all living things on this planet.</i>

00:21:28.140 --> 00:21:30.510
<i>We are the Skrugg.</i>

00:21:30.510 --> 00:21:32.430
<i>Rulers of the universe!</i>

00:21:33.570 --> 00:21:35.460
<i>To repeat:</i>

00:21:35.460 --> 00:21:37.190
<i>We are the Skrugg.</i>

00:21:37.990 --> 00:21:40.710
<i>Rulers of the universe!</i>

00:21:41.690 --> 00:21:47.700
<i>From henceforth we proclaim this planet as ours!</i>

00:21:54.530 --> 00:21:57.280
<i>This decision will not be overturned.</i>

00:21:57.280 --> 00:22:00.960
<i>We will eliminate all who resist without mercy.</i>

00:22:02.410 --> 00:22:04.150
<i>To repeat:</i>

00:22:04.150 --> 00:22:06.270
<i>We are the Skrugg.</i>

00:22:06.270 --> 00:22:09.240
<i>Rulers of the universe!</i>

00:22:20.690 --> 00:22:24.090
<b>"Can you hear this voice?"</b>

00:22:24.090 --> 00:22:31.560
<b>I've been calling that, always, from deep within my heart.</b>

00:22:34.370 --> 00:22:45.460
<b>Would you, all alone, let another lonely one be next to you?</b>

00:22:45.460 --> 00:22:51.010
<b>Because together it's not lonely, it's twoly.</b>

00:22:51.010 --> 00:22:56.140
<b>See, you're not alone any longer.</b>

00:22:57.280 --> 00:22:59.990
<b>Just because there's no one next to me</b>

00:22:59.990 --> 00:23:02.540
<b>doesn't mean that I'm lonely!</b>

00:23:02.540 --> 00:23:07.740
<b>For someone to notice this pain</b>

00:23:07.740 --> 00:23:13.270
<b>that heart must have surely cried.</b>

00:23:13.270 --> 00:23:16.650
<b>Right now, we'll crush to bits</b>

00:23:16.650 --> 00:23:20.350
<b>the fortress of our limitless sadness!</b>

00:23:20.350 --> 00:23:24.050
<b>I'll take you with me!</b>

00:23:24.050 --> 00:23:27.730
<b>Got it? I'm running through at full power.</b>

00:23:27.730 --> 00:23:31.470
<b>To where you're waiting, left behind</b>

00:23:31.470 --> 00:23:34.640
<b>in the place of tears...</b>

00:23:35.950 --> 00:23:39.770
<b>I believe in you, with burning passion!</b>

00:23:39.770 --> 00:23:43.560
<b>Come to me!</b>

00:23:50.850 --> 00:23:52.700
On the next Heroman:

00:23:52.700 --> 00:23:53.990
What's that?

00:23:53.990 --> 00:23:55.530
It's big and round and...

00:23:55.530 --> 00:23:56.660
...a sea urchin?!

00:23:56.660 --> 00:23:59.370
Joey and Psy managed to rescue his grandmother,

00:23:59.370 --> 00:24:04.670
however the Skrugg's Earth invasion plan has proceeded to a new stage.

00:24:05.250 --> 00:24:09.600
People can do nothing but stand their ground against the indestructible,

00:24:09.600 --> 00:24:11.970
super-advanced technological threat closing in on them.

00:24:12.290 --> 00:24:15.610
Next time on Heroman Episode #4: Sphere!

00:24:16.030 --> 00:24:18.800
Heroman... Attack!
